[USER], if `time_input`is based on BaseWeb, is there any possibility to change further settings in BaseWeb's `TimePickerDefaultProps`? 
I mean, how to change the standard 15min interval to i.e. 10min, as requested in #4693? 

```
export type TimePickerDefaultProps = {
  format: '12';
  step: 900;
  creatable: false;
  adapter: DateIOAdapter<Date>;
  ignoreMinMaxDateComponent: false;
};
```
